<title>UK: Beazer Homes up as Merrill Lynch upgrades.</title>
<headline>Beazer Homes up as Merrill Lynch upgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Beazer Homes Plc ticked higher on Wednesday as analysts at Merrill Lynch raised their recommendation and earnings estimates for the housebuilder, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3p at 189 by 1030 GMT.</p>
<p>Market sources said Merrill raised the stock to &quot;neutral&quot; from &quot;reduce&quot; and raised its pre-tax profit estimate 12 percent for the year ending June 1997 to 58 million stg. For the year after it increased by 14 percent to 65.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
